<title>SRI LANKA: Eagle Insurance up on bonus news.</title>
<headline>Eagle Insurance up on bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTC Eagle Insurance Co Ltd rose 1.12 percent, or 50 cents to 45 rupees, on turnover of 1,000 shares on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The rise came after the bonus announcement, when retail investors began collecting the share,&quot; said a broker.</p>
<p>The company announced a one-for-15 bonus issue on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Sellers have now moved back to 47 rupees,&quot; said the broker.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
